const content = `Straight teeth are about more than aesthetics. Optimal tooth alignment supports improved oral hygiene, reduces the risk of infection and gum disease, promotes proper jaw positioning to minimize clenching and grinding, and can even improve sleep quality by addressing sleep-disordered breathing.

At Central Dentist, our doctors have advanced training in comprehensive orthodontics from the United States Dental Institute, and we have found Invisalign to be the most effective tool for achieving the best clinical outcomes in the shortest time for the vast majority of our adult patients.

Invisalign clear aligners are virtually invisible and removable, meaning they integrate seamlessly into your daily life without disrupting your professional career or oral health routine. They are significantly more comfortable than traditional braces and contribute to far less inflammation in the body than any metal-based technique.

Invisalign also leverages artificial intelligence and machine learning, drawing on millions of cases worldwide to optimize every treatment plan. This means your aligners are designed using the collective wisdom of one of the largest orthodontic databases in the world — resulting in more predictable outcomes and faster treatment times.

Our lead provider, Dr. Jill Ombrello, is a member of the American Academy of Clear Aligners (AACA), which means she has received advanced, specialized training in Invisalign case management and is part of a collaborative network of top providers who share expertise daily. Combined with her background in holistic oral health through the International Academy of Oral Medicine and Toxicology (IAOMT), her expertise in sleep, airway, and TMJ health, and her undergraduate training in physical therapy, Dr. Jill brings a uniquely comprehensive perspective to every Invisalign case.

For the majority of our patients, Dr. Jill is able to achieve optimal outcomes in as little as 4 months. We offer complimentary consultations for all new patients, including a simulation of your new smile.`;

